<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Results ‣ Time-To-Inconsistency: A Survival Analysis of Large Language Model Robustness to Adversarial Attacks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Feature Importance and Risk Factor Analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5 Results ‣ Time-To-Inconsistency: A Survival Analysis of Large Language Model Robustness to Adversarial Attacks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Temporal Failure Patterns</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Time-To-Inconsistency: A Survival Analysis of Large Language Model Robustness to Adversarial Attacks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussion</span></a></li>
